        ":question/problem": "If $\\overset{\\to }{U}=⟨1,3⟩$ and $\\overset{\\to }{V}=⟨6,3⟩$, then $\\overset{\\to }{U}+\\overset{\\to }{V}=$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{U}+\\overset{\\to }{V} & =⟨1,3⟩+⟨6,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1+6,3+3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨7,6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$"
